UID:march-2027-anchorage@solar-events.local
DTSTAMP:20260924T025833Z
DTSTART:20270320T202645Z
SUMMARY:🌷 March Equinox
DESCRIPTION:One of two days each year when day and night are approximately equal in length worldwide.\n\nEstimated daylight: 12h 00m (at 61.22°N)\nExact moment: 12:26 PM AKDT
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/March_equinox
CATEGORIES:Astronomy,Solar Events
COLOR:lightpink
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:March Equinox
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
