UID:dst-end-2026-anchorage@dst.local
DTSTAMP:20260924T025833Z
DTSTART:20261101T020000
SUMMARY:⏪️ DST Ends
DESCRIPTION:Clocks move back one hour.\n\nAKDT (UTC-08:00) becomes AKST (UTC-09:00)\nExact moment: 2:00 AM AKDT
CATEGORIES:Daylight Saving Time,Time Change
COLOR:mediumseagreen
END:VEVENT
